    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "CME proudly welcomes you to No. 20 Riverwalk, a contemporary interpretation of the traditional Irish cottage, located in this award winning, innovative development built by Ballymore Homes. Riverwalk stands on the banks of the Liffey and compromises an eclectic mix of unique homes surrounded by landscaped green spaces and planting and has direct access to the renowned Ballymore 5km Walking Loop which brings you along the banks of the Liffey into tranquil forest, Golden Falls and Reservoir, a beautiful walkway literally on the doorstep. No. 20 is a beautifully presented 2 bedroom energy efficient home boasting spacious proportions, raised ceiling heights, superior kitchen & bathroom finishes as well as a Sunny South facing garden, ideal for relaxing & entertaining. The décor of this lovely home is a twist on the traditional country abode, with timeless understated elegance yet contemporary & practical design making it a wonderful future proofed home to enjoy. Viewing strictly by appointment with sole agents CME 045-897711."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION \r\nEntrance Hall: c. 4.2m x 1.8m\r\nWith tiled floor in exquisite design. Alarm point. Full bank of storage housing utility area and hotpress.\r\n\r\nOpen Plan Lounge/ Dining / Kitchen: c. 6.1m x 5.7m\r\nStunning room with vaulted ceiling creating wonderful space and bathed in natural light via the multiple windows & glazed doors. Terrazzo inspired flooring. Bespoke cabinetry with classic and elegant design finished in Olive Green & Oak effect, complimented by slate effect work surfaces and upstands. Range style oven, integrated dishwasher, SMEG fridge and butler style sink unit finished with brass hardware. Sliding glazed doors leading to rear. Spacious proportions with ample areas for living and dining. Built in media unit and bookcase with clever sliding screen.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom: c. 5.10m x 3.15m\r\nBeautifully presented with high quality carpet & neutral décor. Full bank of wardrobes with excellent storage. Sliding doors allows access to rear garden.\r\nAccess to attic via Stira stairs. \r\n\r\nEnsuite: c. 2.60m x 1.90m\r\nWith walk in double shower with rain water shower head. Quality sanitary ware with classically designed wash hand basin, vanity and WC. Tiled floor & walls. Spotlights to ceiling.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: c.3.7m x 3.0m \r\nSpacious proportions. Quality fitted carpets. Sliding patio doors leading to rear garden. \r\n\r\nBathroom: c. 2.60m x 2.10m \r\nExquisitely designed with traditional sanitary ware including pull chain wc, wash hand basin & free standing bath. Elegant tiling leading from hallway and ivory brick effect wall tiles to wet areas.\r\n\r\nOutside: \r\nTo the front there is parking for Two cars as well as an electric car charge point. Mulched and planted flowerbeds softly surround the front exterior & recessed doorway. Cobbled side pathway leading to gated side entrance opening to a good sized South facing sunny garden which is walled and laid mostly in lawn with a paved patio ideal for outdoor dining, relaxing and entertaining. Barna shed. Outside socket & light."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "2 Bedroom/2 Bathroom Cottage \r\nExclusive development; built by Ballymore Homes\r\nUnique and contemporary design\r\nA rated energy efficient home with heat pump and mechanical ventilation system \r\nStylish interiors with a clever fusion of modern & traditional elements \r\nSpacious proportions throughout\r\n2 double sized bedrooms with access to garden \r\nHigh quality kitchen appliances, sanitary ware & flooring throughout\r\nOn the banks of the River Liffey and the Ballymore 5km Walking Loop.\r\nAdjacent to primary school\r\nVillage lifestyle & sense of community, yet only 10mins from larger towns of Naas & Blessington."
      },
